<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.26 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.26 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bills auction on Tuesday compared to the September 24 auction  SUVK :</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				194-day T-bills   169-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.28 pct	    3.27 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.28 pct	    3.29 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.28 pct	    3.26 pct</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million	  400		   135</p>
<p> Bids, million mk	     1,643		 485</p>
<p> Maturing date	    April 15, 1997    March 14, 1997</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				285-day T-bills   263-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.41 pct	    3.41 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.41 pct	    3.41 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.41 pct	    3.39 pct</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million	  100		   550</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million	    520		   550</p>
<p> Maturing date	    July 15, 1997     June 16, 1997</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				347-day T-bills   354-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.48 pct	    3.51 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.48 pct	    3.51 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.47 pct	    3.50 pct</p>
<p> Amount, million mk	   760		   820</p>
<p> Bids, million mk	     1,176		 1,060</p>
<p> Maturing date	    Sept 15, 1997     Sept 15, 1997</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.5 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 49,324 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
